9/CVE-1999-0679.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/ab4d5447f6ae2c4c3eb5c082fd4adfb5e47fd740/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-3c24-mx8q-qwqm/GHSA-3c24-mx8q-qwqm.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/1999/CVE-1999-0679.json","https://github.com/intSpLoiT/intframework/blob/eabaa799d0260aa52b735fa9769266d1ce4b64ef/modules/cve_list.txt","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--53a24dd1-2f0b-4489-8912-d13ab5816b7a.json","https://github.com/leego972/titanai/blob/afa5b2310463aae5781d3fd9408071bf38e79806/data/raw/corpus_D_cyber/nvd_cve_000727.txt","https://github.com/hungryfoolou/Vulnerability_Mining/blob/3df1d8ed0489ae1228f975ae1f58a690aae53886/craw/cveid_craw/cveid_craw/data/cveid_by_kind/cveid_overflow.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0225.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0679","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0679.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0679","title":"hybrid-6 IRC 服务器 m_invite 缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"hybrid-6 IRC 服务器（EFnet 常用）的 m_invite 功能存在缓冲区溢出漏洞，远程攻击者可通过发送特制的 invite 选项触发溢出，从而在目标系统上执行任意命令。该漏洞可导致服务器完全被控制，需立即修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0679"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-08-13T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 hybrid IRC 服务器至已修复该漏洞的最新版本，或从 efnet 官方存档获取补丁更新 m_invite 函数，限制 IRC 服务器的远程访问权限以降低暴露风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/581","http://www.efnet.org/archive/servers/hybrid/ChangeLog"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0679.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1052","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1052.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-1336","title":"3Com HiPerARC 远程Telnet IAC数据包洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"3Com HiPer Access Router Card (HiperARC) 4.0至4.2.29版本中的Telnet服务存在拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向Telnet端口发送大量IAC(Interpret As Command)数据包，导致设备CPU过载并触发系统重启，造成服务不可用。攻击无需认证，仅需网络可达即可实施。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-1336"],"sources":["cve","avd"],"published":"1999-08-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"该产品已停止支持，无官方补丁。建议在边界防火墙上禁用Telnet服务（端口23）或使用ACL限制可访问Telnet端口的来源IP地址；如业务允许，应替换为支持安全远程管理的现代设备。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T12:07:47Z","references":[],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1052.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0321","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0321.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0724","title":"OpenBSD procfs/fdescfs readdir 缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"OpenBSD 的 procfs 和 fdescfs 文件系统在 readdir() 函数中处理 uio_offset 参数时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞。本地攻击者可利用精心构造的 uio_offset 值触发缓冲区越界写入，导致内核内存损坏，进而实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 OpenBSD 2.5 及更早版本，但 procfs 和 fdescfs 默认未启用。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.6,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0724"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"1999-08-12T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级到 OpenBSD 2.6 或更高版本。对于 OpenBSD 2.5，应用 errata 002 补丁。建议在不必要时禁用 procfs 和 fdescfs 文件系统。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-16T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.openbsd.org/errata25.html","http://www.osvdb.org/6128"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0321.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-1100","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-1100.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0875","title":"Microsoft Windows / Solaris ICMP Router Discovery Protocol 默认路由篡改漏洞","description":"ICMP 路由器发现协议（IRDP）存在设计缺陷，远程攻击者可向目标系统发送伪造的 ICMP 路由器通告报文，修改受影响主机的默认路由表。当运行 Microsoft Windows 98a/98b/98SE 或 Solaris 2.6 的系统启用了 IRDP 时，攻击者无需认证即可将网络流量重定向至恶意主机，进而实施中间人攻击、数据窃听或流量劫持。该漏洞利用门槛低，仅需目标处于同一广播域且 IRDP 处于默认启用状态。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0875"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:14Z","remediation":"对于 Windows 98 系统，在注册表 HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\\System\\CurrentControlSet\\Services\\VxD\\DHCP 下将 PerformRouterDiscovery 设为 0 以禁用 IRDP；对于 Solaris 2.6，在 /etc/default/inetinit 中将 IRDP 相关参数禁用或升级至受支持的 Solaris 版本。由于上述系统均已停止支持，建议迁移至受支持的操作系统版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ216141","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/578","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19451","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0875.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a5db9ce197a4914a8237308d958cd159d8832fe6/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0875.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0875","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0875.json","https://github.com/eldondev/Snort/blob/34bdcf6a7a638b55c7c04f77ef1efa526ad08e33/doc/signatures/363.txt","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0875.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-5pjr-xvrx-vmj4/GHSA-5pjr-xvrx-vmj4.json","https://github.com/rhuitl/uClinux/blob/0486e80a025dccbe4a2213715a2ab8a5063ea86b/user/snort/drop-rules/icmp-info.rules","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/bailehang/snort_2.2.0/blob/34f8a3a85f15645aea53d6e0d46863c7c57e43ef/doc/signatures/364.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-1100.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-1999-0667","file_name":"1999/AVE-1999-0667.toml","cve_id":"CVE-1999-0867","title":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 HTTP请求畸形标头洪水拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Microsoft IIS 4.0 存在输入验证不当导致的拒绝服务漏洞。远程攻击者可通过向目标服务器发送大量包含畸形 HTTP 请求头的报文，触发 IIS 服务进程崩溃，导致网站无法正常响应合法用户请求。该漏洞影响 IIS 4.0 及 Microsoft Commercial Internet System 2.0/2.5、Site Server Commerce Edition 3.0 等产品，CVSS 评分 5.0，危害等级中危。攻击者无需身份认证即可远程利用，但无法实现代码执行或数据窃取。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-1999-0867"],"sources":["epss"],"published":"1999-08-11T04:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-16T21:49:13Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 安全公告 MS99-029 提供的补丁程序，该补丁修复了 IIS 4.0 对畸形 HTTP 请求头处理不当导致的拒绝服务问题。受影响产品包括 IIS 4.0、Site Server 3.0、Site Server 3.0 Commerce Edition 及 Microsoft Commercial Internet System 2.0/2.5。如无法安装补丁，可在网络边界防火墙或 IIS 中配置限制单个 IP 的并发连接数，并监控异常大量 HTTP 请求以缓解攻击。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-18T00:00:00Z","references":["http://support.microsoft.com/default.aspx?scid=kb%3B%5BLN%5D%3BQ238349","http://www.ciac.org/ciac/bulletins/j-058.shtml","http://www.securityfocus.com/bid/579","https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/security-updates/securitybulletins/1999/ms99-029","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/19457","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/638563f1ec085a412c2e42f3935801ae34f0dfd9/1999/CVE-1999-0867.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/42b5b7a8a9b34b1b292b9bfd27242e499ccb6cb9/cves/1999/0xxx/CVE-1999-0867.json","https://github.com/LiuCan01/cve-list-pro/blob/78b55511cee3604c22d518e32822f0435d0cacc0/cve-list/CVE-1999/CVE-1999-0867","https://github.com/edoardottt/missing-cve-nuclei-templates/blob/36c16d53eb6071e39cfc3cf88e99f1b340ec913b/data/year/1999.txt","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/21d84550d4f5d6b78cac9f7c41b1b20a874c9f15/CVE/data/1999/CVE-1999-0867.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/1999/CVE-1999-0867.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/d94ad47d0f2016e121b6d251f490e890714f8916/advisories/unreviewed/2022/04/GHSA-m9hv-pvv3-2735/GHSA-m9hv-pvv3-2735.json","https://github.com/marcellodesales/aibbp-reverse-engineer/blob/960f610d597aae9fec1cc5f03c68679be00c222d/reverse_engineer/acunetix/vulnerabilities/vdb/1999/0xxx/cve-1999-0867.yaml","https://github.com/feng-li/tools-for-data-science-course/blob/8e62d47ee8ffbebe9a0e50aee193617f83883118/2019spring/2017312271/result.txt","https://github.com/blackhook/nessus-plugins/blob/64177d96abbb07c58cf7e131046b067ebc61fcb5/I/iis_malformed_request.nasl"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/1999/POC-AVE-1999-0667.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/1999/EXP-AVE-1999-0667.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/1999/AVE-1999-0667.toml"}]